    },
    {
      "text": "To make the peanut dressing: Whisk rice vinegar, oil, peanut butter, soy sauce, brown sugar, ginger, and garlic together in a medium bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WGicNi9-DMMFPni0gBcf_8X7Mto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14297-asian-coleslaw-VAT-step-02-71026521f9354dc6ad59251b5c443b19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14297/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the coleslaw: Mix green cabbage, red cabbage, napa cabbage, red bell peppers, carrots, green onions, and cilantro in a large bowl.",
